---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Work | Arun Annavaram">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Work</h1>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold">Professional experience</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      <li><strong>Jira Cloud administration:</strong> user management, permission schemes, project settings, governance and compliance.</li>
      <li><strong>Access management:</strong> provisioning, deactivation and access requests, plus involvement in access request and approval workflows and Active Directory group synchronization.</li>
      <li><strong>Level 3 support:</strong> production incidents, escalations and root-cause analysis.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold">Currently learning</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      <li>Linux</li>
      <li>Python scripting for DevOps automation</li>
      <li>Jira APIs, exploring integration and automation</li>
      <li>Docker, Kubernetes and cloud fundamentals</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold">Projects</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      <strong>This website.</strong> Built with Astro and Tailwind CSS, with the
      source on <a class="underline" href="https://github.com/arunreddy503/arunannavaram-site">GitHub</a>,
      deployed automatically through Cloudflare on my own domain.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-500">[Placeholder: more projects as I build them.]</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
